<title>USA: Donnkenny sees Q4 shipments up, higher 1996 revs.</title>
<headline>Donnkenny sees Q4 shipments up, higher 1996 revs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's sportswear maker Donnkenny Inc Wednesday said it sees strong fourth quarter shipments, and expects fiscal 1996 revenues to be significantly ahead of fiscal 1995's.</p>
<p>Donnkenny previously reported 1995 revenues at $210 million.</p>
<p>The firm expects an audit of its restated 1994 and 1995 fiscal year results to be concluded with the audit of the current fiscal year, ending December 31.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
